Tool response:
Tool: reroute_shipment
Description: Reroute an in-transit LTL shipment to a new destination.
Validates status and existence of 'delivery attempted' event.
Creates a new location if necessary, creates a reroute request, updates shipment.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "shipment_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Shipment Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "new_destination_address": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "New Destination Address",
          "description": "Full address of the new destination (line1, line2, city, state)"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Reason",
          "description": "Reason for the reroute request"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "shipment_id",
        "new_destination_address",
        "reason"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: get_shipment_details
Description: Retrieve detailed information about a specific shipment.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "shipment_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Shipment Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "shipment_id"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: create_location
Description: Create a new location record.
Checks if location already exists to avoid duplicates if possible, but primarily inserts.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "address_line1": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Address Line1"
        },
        "address_line2": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Address Line2"
        },
        "city": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "City"
        },
        "state": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "State"
        },
        "postal_code": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Postal Code"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "address_line1",
        "city",
        "state"
      ]
    }
